[statement]
Where several packages installed provide a name a dependency states, the
walk follows the one installed for the request: `zp`, requested, comes
before `a`, and `bp`, installed for `c`, after it, though `bp` states the
higher priority.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:v

P:zp
V:1
p:v
k:1

P:bp
V:1
p:v
k:9

P:c
V:1
D:bp

[request]
a
zp
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install zp 1
install a 1
install bp 1
install c 1
